# Copy to qa/publish-deny.txt (gitignored, never committed).
# One term per line, matched case insensitively against every text file that
# qa/publish.js is about to push. A hit refuses the whole publish and prints
# the entry NUMBER, never the term.
#
# Put here: the name of any real athlete, family or donor that must never
# appear in a published artifact, by every spelling that could appear. Dave
# holds the list. The repo does not, on purpose: writing the names into a
# committed file would be the leak this list exists to prevent.
